# Copy to .env.local. Every NEXT_PUBLIC_* value is public: it is inlined into
# the browser bundle at build time (a change needs a rebuild).
#
# ── Hosted (Vercel) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A public deployment sets, before it builds:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_POLARIS_API_URL=https://<Polaris for Business>   required
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAIN_ID=5042002                                 Arc testnet
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_RP_ID=<the app's domain, or a domain it is under> strongly advised
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_PRIVY_APP_ID=<the dashboard's Privy app>          optional (email)
# and never NEXT_PUBLIC_DEV_SIGNER, NEXT_PUBLIC_DEV_SIGNER_PERSIST,
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LOCAL_DEMO or NEXT_PUBLIC_LOCAL_FAUCET_URL. GET /api/health
# reports what the build has.

# ── Polaris for Business ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The relayer (POST /api/relay), checkout sessions (/api/public/sessions/{id}),
# the network's contracts and EIP-712 domains (/api/public/network), the CCTP
# mint relay (/api/public/cctp/mint) and the credit guard. Local:
# http://localhost:3100. Required: unset, every route shows "Polaris isn't
# configured on this build", with no data, and nothing can be signed.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_POLARIS_API_URL=http://localhost:3100

# ── Chain ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 5042002 Arc testnet (the default), 5042 Arc mainnet, 31337 a local Hardhat
# node (`pnpm --filter @polarispay/contracts node:local`, port 8600). The app
# refuses to sign if Polaris for Business reports another chain.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAIN_ID=5042002
# Read-only RPC. Unset: https://rpc.testnet.arc.io (testnet),
# https://rpc.mainnet.arc.io (mainnet), http://127.0.0.1:8600 (31337).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_RPC_URL=https://rpc.testnet.arc.io
# Where "View receipt" goes. Unset: https://explorer.testnet.arc.io (testnet),
# https://explorer.arc.io (mainnet), none on a local chain.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_EXPLORER_URL=https://explorer.testnet.arc.io

# ── Contract pins (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every address comes from NEXT_PUBLIC_POLARIS_API_URL's /api/public/network
# (the deployment record), with its EIP-712 domain. Set one here and it pins
# this build: the app refuses to sign if the server reports a different one.
# USDC on Arc (both networks; 6 decimals as an ERC-20, and Arc's gas token).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_USDC_ADDRESS=0x3600000000000000000000000000000000000000
# EURC (testnet; mainnet is 0xbEf5f6d51CB62b58e6A8f77868681825C6fe21c1).
# Unset and not deployed (a local chain): no euro balance, no euro links.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_EURC_ADDRESS=0x89B50855Aa3bE2F677cD6303Cec089B5F319D72a
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PAYMENTS_ADDRESS=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CHECKOUT_ADDRESS=
# PolarisSend on USDC (send dollars by link).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SEND_ADDRESS=
# PolarisSend on EURC (send euros by link). Unset and not deployed: Send
# offers dollars only.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SEND_EURC_ADDRESS=
# PolarisSplit (split-the-bill links). Not deployed: Split a bill says so.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SPLIT_ADDRESS=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LOAN_ENGINE_ADDRESS=

# ── Accounts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The WebAuthn relying party. A passkey, and so a Polaris account, is tied to
# it forever. Production: polarispay.app (serves app. and pay.). Leave it unset
# in dev to use the page's hostname (localhost).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_RP_ID=polarispay.app
# Privy: "Continue with email" beneath Face ID. The same Privy app as the
# dashboard. Unset hides the option.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PRIVY_APP_ID=
# Optional: a Privy app client made for this web origin.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PRIVY_CLIENT_ID=

# ── Development only (`next dev`) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# "1" replaces Face ID with a random key in this tab's sessionStorage, so flows
# can be exercised headlessly; a "Dev signer" badge shows while it is on.
# `next build` blanks it unless POLARIS_ALLOW_DEV_SIGNER_BUILD=1 (a local CI
# run). Never set it in a deployed environment.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEV_SIGNER=
# "1" keeps the dev signer's key for the device (localStorage), so a shop's
# checkout popup opens as the same buyer as the app's tab. Dev only.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEV_SIGNER_PERSIST=
# The local faucet Add money offers on chain 31337 (POST {url}/mint {address}).
# Ignored on any other chain; Arc testnet links to https://faucet.circle.com.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LOCAL_FAUCET_URL=
# "1" on a local chain: "Raise your limit" may use a stand-in history wallet
# when the browser has none.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LOCAL_DEMO=

# ── Server only (not NEXT_PUBLIC) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Where /api/fx reads the Chainlink FX feeds behind the local-currency line
# (display only; they live on other chains, not Arc). Comma-separated JSON-RPC
# URLs; the defaults are public, keyless endpoints (packages/fx/src/feeds.ts).
# FX_RPC_ETHEREUM=https://ethereum-rpc.publicnode.com,https://cloudflare-eth.com
# FX_RPC_POLYGON=https://polygon-bor-rpc.publicnode.com,https://1rpc.io/matic
# FX_RPC_BASE=https://mainnet.base.org,https://base-rpc.publicnode.com
